					<description><![CDATA[As an efficient, durable and economical filtration solution, stainless steel filter bags can provide reliable filtration performance in a variety of industrial applications. It is widely used in industrial filtration, especially in liquid and gas filtration processes.
<ul>
 	<li><strong>Material</strong>: SUS304, SUS316.</li>
 	<li><strong>Mesh</strong>：200-500.</li>
 	<li><strong>Joining Craftsmanship</strong>: Welding, Sewing.</li>
 	<li><strong>Application</strong>: Liquid filtration.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[		<div data-elementor-type="product-post" data-elementor-id="3778" class="elementor elementor-3778" data-elementor-post-type="product">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f760ef9 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent" data-id="f760ef9" data-element_type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8b18b53 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="8b18b53" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<ul><li>The non-deformable SUS304 or SUS316 stainless steel is spun into a mesh according to the specified specifications, and then becomes a monofilament mesh after heat setting.</li><li>High strength and will not deform due to changes in pressure.</li><li>The monofilament weave creates a smooth surface that is easy to clean and can be used over and over again.</li></ul><h3>Product Features</h3><ul><li><strong>High quality stainless steel material, deep filtering.</strong></li></ul>						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ed981ba elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="ed981ba" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
