				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<ul><li><strong>The bag body is edged with corrosion-resistant material and tightly sewn with multiple threads.</strong></li></ul>						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1fbcbb1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="1fbcbb1" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
