													<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="750" height="500" src="https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Stainless-Steel-Filter-Bags-06-detail3.jpg" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-3786" alt="" srcset="https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Stainless-Steel-Filter-Bags-06-detail3.jpg 750w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Stainless-Steel-Filter-Bags-06-detail3-300x200.jpg 300w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Stainless-Steel-Filter-Bags-06-detail3-600x400.jpg 600w" sizes="(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px" />													</div>
				</div>
