					<description><![CDATA[Polypropylene Filter Bags is an excellent industrial filtration product, which is mainly used for liquid filtration. It is made of polypropylene fiber as the main material, with the advantages of chemical corrosion resistance, high temperature resistance, high strength, etc., and is widely used in many fields, including chemical, pharmaceutical, food, beverage, coating, ink and other industries.
<ul>
 	<li><strong>Material</strong>: Polypropylene needle felt.</li>
 	<li><strong>Filtration Accuracy</strong>: Micron.</li>
 	<li><strong>Post-processing</strong>: Calendering, Heat setting, Singing.</li>
 	<li><strong>Size</strong>: Customized.</li>
 	<li><strong>Sealing Method</strong>: Needle sealing, Hot melt sealing.</li>
 	<li><strong>Bag Mouth Sealing Ring Type</strong>: stainless steel, plastic.</li>
 	<li><strong>Bag Bottom Type</strong>: Round, V-shaped, Flat.</li>
 	<li><strong>Application</strong>: Liquid filtration.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
