					<description><![CDATA[PTFE filter bags have perfect filtration performance during water pre-treatment and post-treatment. As an upgraded version of PTFE, ePTFE is more flexible, breathable and filterable.
<ul>
 	<li><strong>Size</strong>: Customized.</li>
 	<li><strong>Material</strong>: PTFE Needle Punched Felt.</li>
 	<li><strong>Bag Shape</strong>: Round or Pleat.</li>
