													<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="734" height="448" src="https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Nylon-Filter-Bags-detail1.jpg" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-2558" alt="" srcset="https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Nylon-Filter-Bags-detail1.jpg 734w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Nylon-Filter-Bags-detail1-300x183.jpg 300w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Nylon-Filter-Bags-detail1-600x366.jpg 600w" sizes="(max-width: 734px) 100vw, 734px" />													</div>
