							<h3>Precautions</h3><ul><li>Temperature limit: Nylon has limited high temperature resistance and is generally not suitable for long-term use in environments exceeding 100°C.</li><li>Acidic environment: Nylon has poor resistance to strong acids and may degrade in strong acidic environments.</li><li>Regular inspection and maintenance: In order to ensure the filtration effect and the life of the filter bag, the integrity of the filter bag needs to be checked regularly and necessary cleaning and maintenance must be performed.</li></ul>						</div>
