<ul>
<li>A wide range of filter materials in different micron ratings and designs.</li>
<li>Plastic flanges or metal rings for wide temperature compatibility.</li>
<li>Material are FDA compliant.</li>
<li>Silicone free construction.</li>
<li>High dirt holding capacity..</li>
</ul>
<hr />
